Origin:
Allwinner A733 (sun60iw2) and the Orange Pi Zero 4: the clock control unit,
the SD/MMC controller variant and device trees. With these the board boots
from microSD to multi-user on the serial console. The register map was read
on the board and agrees with the vendor kernel. The clock and reset numbers
are those of the Linux binding allwinner,sun60i-a733-ccu (v3, September
2026), whose headers are imported unchanged.

The boot loader leaves the SD card write threshold enabled, and the first
write through the internal DMA never completes; the A733 variant of
sunximmc clears it on host reset.

--- sys/arch/arm/sunxi/files.sunxi
+++ sys/arch/arm/sunxi/files.sunxi
@@ -78,6 +78,11 @@ device	sun50ih6ccu: sunxi_ccu
 attach	sun50ih6ccu at fdt with sunxi_h6_ccu
 file	arch/arm/sunxi/sun50i_h6_ccu.c		sunxi_h6_ccu
 
+# CCU (A733)
+device	sun60ia733ccu: sunxi_ccu
+attach	sun60ia733ccu at fdt with sunxi_a733_ccu
+file	arch/arm/sunxi/sun60i_a733_ccu.c	sunxi_a733_ccu
+
 # CCU (H6 PRCM)
 device	sun50ih6rccu: sunxi_ccu
 attach	sun50ih6rccu at fdt with sunxi_h6_r_ccu
